Here at Waikato Uni, NZ,   we have only the basic 'HACK' on the VAX,
not the flashy version that I read about all over this conference
      [ although we've got NetHack on the Macintoshes   8-)   ]
Anyway, me and a friend spent...  a few days... compiling a list of anything
 we could find out about the game.
We ended up with 3 files,  one .REC file,  one file on monsters,  and one
 file listing items.
I hardly ever play this now ( you can only finish it once.. ) so don't bother
 replying to me,  but I thought I 'd better donate this to someone else
 before I delete it..

Have Fun!
